        "original_id": "20695b6f-df23-5dea-a5bb-bf4901e8d214",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Doomsday Prophecy, Firefly, Serenity, Stargate Atlantis\n- People: Jason Bourque, Jewel Staite, Alan Dale, A.J. Buckley\n- Roles: Kaylee Frye, Dr. Jennifer Keller\n- Topics: science fiction disaster television films, television series\n\nFacts:\n- Firefly is a Fox television series that ran from 2002 to 2003, and Jewel Staite is known for playing Kaylee Frye in it.\n- Serenity is a 2005 theatrical spin-off film of Firefly, and Jewel Staite is known for reprising Kaylee Frye in it.\n- Stargate Atlantis is a science-fiction television series on Sci-Fi Channel that ran from 2007 to 2009, and Jewel Staite is known for playing Dr. Jennifer Keller in it.\n- Doomsday Prophecy is a 2011 sci-fi disaster television film directed by Jason Bourque and starring Jewel Staite, Alan Dale, and A.J. Buckley.",
